  "final_message": "The root cause was in `due_for_retry`: it selected every open invoice on every billing cycle, regardless of its scheduled retry time. I changed it to select only open invoices whose `next_attempt_at` is due.\n\nA regression test confirms the default policy makes four attempts total, on days 0, 1, 3, and 7, then moves the subscription to `unpaid`. All 25 tests pass. I also wrote [answer.json](/tmp/bsvc-leg1m8b4/billing-service/answer.json).",
